---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import packaging from "../assets/petid-packaging.jpeg";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <main class="page home-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy fade-up">
        <p class="eyebrow">Siempre cerca</p>
        <h1>Una pequeña medalla.<br/><span>Una gran tranquilidad.</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">PetID guarda la información esencial de tu mascota en un QR para que quien la encuentre pueda ayudarte a traerla de vuelta.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/pet/PETIDTEST002">Activar mi PetID <Icon name="arrow" /></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/pet/PETIDTEST001">Ver perfil de muestra <span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-row">
          <span><Icon name="shield" size={18} /> Perfil protegido</span>
          <span><Icon name="scan" size={18} /> Sin apps</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="product-stage fade-up" style="--delay: 120ms">
        <span class="stage-label">Tu compañero, identificado</span>
        <div class="product-glow"></div>
        <Image src={packaging} alt="Packaging y medalla PetID de color celeste" widths={[420, 700, 1024]} sizes="(max-width: 759px) 88vw, 480px" loading="eager" />
        <div class="floating-note note-one"><Icon name="map" size={18} /><span><b>Ubicación</b> a un toque</span></div>
        <div class="floating-note note-two"><Icon name="heart" size={18} /><span>Hecho para<br/><b>volver a casa</b></span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="how section">
      <div class="section-heading fade-up">
        <p class="eyebrow">Simple de verdad</p>
        <h2>Tres pasos. Cero vueltas.</h2>
        <p>La persona que encuentra a tu mascota no instala nada ni crea una cuenta.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <article class="step-card fade-up" style="--delay: 60ms">
          <span class="step-number">01</span>
          <span class="step-icon"><Icon name="scan" size={27} /></span>
          <h3>Escanea</h3>
          <p>La cámara abre el perfil digital al instante.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step-card fade-up" style="--delay: 120ms">
          <span class="step-number">02</span>
          <span class="step-icon"><Icon name="pets" size={27} /></span>
          <h3>Reconoce</h3>
          <p>Ve su foto, nombre y si está reportada como perdida.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step-card fade-up" style="--delay: 180ms">
          <span class="step-number">03</span>
          <span class="step-icon"><Icon name="whatsapp" size={27} /></span>
          <h3>Contacta</h3>
          <p>Abre WhatsApp y la ubicación sin perder tiempo.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing-card fade-up">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">PetID</p>
        <h2>Su historia y su hogar,<br/>en un solo lugar.</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-dark" href="/pet/PETIDTEST002">Empezar ahora <Icon name="arrow" /></a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    gap: 34px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    padding-top: 14px;
  }

  h1 span {
    color: var(--sky-600);
  }

  .hero-copy .lead {
    max-width: 590px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: grid;
    gap: 17px;
  }

  .text-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 7px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .text-link span {
    color: var(--sky-600);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .trust-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 27px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .trust-row span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .trust-row :global(.icon) {
    color: var(--sky-600);
  }

  .product-stage {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    min-height: 390px;
    padding: 28px 18px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 34px;
    color: var(--white);
    background: #070a0d;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .product-stage :global(img) {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 470px;
    margin: 12px auto 0;
    object-fit: contain;
    mix-blend-mode: screen;
    animation: float 5.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .stage-label {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    display: block;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.65);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .product-glow {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 0;
    right: -20%;
    bottom: -25%;
    width: 85%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(43, 179, 235, 0.36);
    filter: blur(60px);
  }

  .floating-note {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 9px 11px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    border-radius: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.8);
    background: rgba(16, 24, 30, 0.72);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .floating-note b { color: var(--white); }
  .floating-note :global(.icon) { color: var(--sky-400); }
  .note-one { left: 12px; bottom: 22%; }
  .note-two { right: 12px; bottom: 8%; }

  .section-heading {
    max-width: 540px;
  }

  .section-heading > p:last-child {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .step-card {
    position: relative;
    padding: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
  }

  .step-number {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    right: 17px;
    color: #d3e5ed;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .step-icon {
    display: grid;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    place-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    color: var(--sky-700);
    background: var(--sky-100);
  }

  .step-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  .closing-card {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 34px;
    padding: 28px 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    color: var(--white);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%, rgba(88,198,242,.35), transparent 20rem),
      var(--ink);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .closing-card .eyebrow { color: var(--sky-400); }
  .closing-card .button-dark { color: var(--ink); background: var(--white); }

  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1.03fr .97fr;
      gap: 58px;
      min-height: 650px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .product-stage { min-height: 540px; padding: 34px; }
    .product-stage :global(img) { max-height: 480px; }
    .steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
    .step-card { min-height: 240px; padding: 25px; }
    .closing-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: center; padding: 50px; }
    .closing-card .button { width: auto; }
  }
</style>
